# Copy to .env.local (never commit it), then restart `pnpm dev`.
# With no key, FinGuard runs fully offline with a built-in model that follows the same goals and tools.

# Option A: OpenRouter (one key, any provider). Default model: anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# FINGUARD_MODEL=anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5

# Option B: Anthropic directly. Default model: claude-haiku-4-5
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# FINGUARD_MODEL picks the model. With OpenRouter it is any OpenRouter model id that supports tools
# (e.g. deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash, google/gemini-3.5-flash). Without OpenRouter it is a model bundled with Mozaik.
